1
00:00:20,520 --> 00:00:23,452
Today we'll try
some resistance training.

2
00:00:30,155 --> 00:00:34,868
Push back
against my pull, okay?

3
00:00:36,119 --> 00:00:39,122
Ready... one, two.

4
00:00:39,789 --> 00:00:42,083
Wow...

5
00:00:42,083 --> 00:00:43,915
this is harder than I thought.

6
00:00:46,156 --> 00:00:48,476
That just means it's working.

7
00:00:52,021 --> 00:00:55,733
Let me fix your posture.

8
00:01:01,561 --> 00:01:04,564
Okay, one more time.

9
00:01:05,652 --> 00:01:06,737
What do you mean?

10
00:01:06,900 --> 00:01:10,236
I used to always
look for a reason...

11
00:01:10,328 --> 00:01:13,206
but feelings
don't always need one.

12
00:01:13,531 --> 00:01:15,116
Go on.

13
00:01:15,116 --> 00:01:16,785
When I'm with him
I feel... different.

14
00:01:18,328 --> 00:01:20,955
I just...

15
00:01:23,166 --> 00:01:26,586
want to be near him.

16
00:01:31,708 --> 00:01:33,084
Oh, I'm sorry.

17
00:01:33,085 --> 00:01:35,379
Hang on. I have to take this.

18
00:01:39,808 --> 00:01:42,811
Hey, Ji-sung. You called?

19
00:01:42,811 --> 00:01:44,312
Is now a good time?

20
00:01:44,312 --> 00:01:46,397
Yes, go ahead.

21
00:01:46,397 --> 00:01:49,400
Do you have time
after rehab tomorrow?

22
00:01:50,860 --> 00:01:53,863
Yes, I do.
